OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly fine but on the cloudy
OL,6,Fside at times. A few mainly light
OL,7,Fshowers are possible, with these more
OL,8,Flikely in the west, with the east
OL,9,Fbrightest. Generally very warm and
OL,10,Fhumid, but becoming breezier later.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine evening leading into a
OL,13,Fmild night. Becoming cloudier from the
OL,14,Fwest during the early hours, ahead of
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy rain spreading
OL,16,Fsoutheast by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
