OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly cloud and rain clearing
OL,6,Fto a brighter, fresher-feeling day,
OL,7,Fwith some warm sunny spells and a
OL,8,Fnorthwesterly wind. Cloudier at times
OL,9,Fin the west, with isolated showers
OL,10,Fpossible.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,13,Fchangeable period, with nearer-normal
OL,14,Ftemperatures than of late as showers
OL,15,For longer spells of rain move through,
OL,16,Finterspersed with brighter, drier
OL,17,Finterludes. Often breezy, with
OL,18,Foccasionally strong winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
